OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,FIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,8,Fhave killed at least 11 people, in the
OL,9,Fdeadliest attacks since a precarious
OL,10,Ftruce went into effect on June 20.
OL,12,FLebanon's Health Ministry and state
OL,13,Fnews agency said one of the airstrikes
OL,14,Fthat targeted a home on the edge of
OL,15,Fthe village of Ansar killed seven
OL,16,Fpeople, including three children, and
OL,17,Fwounded two. The second, on the
OL,18,Fvillage of Deir al-Zahrani, killed
OL,19,Ffour and wounded 17.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
