CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,FIsrael and the Lebanese government
OL,8,Fannounced a "framework agreement" on
OL,9,FJune 26, laying out a plan for Israeli
OL,10,Fforces to withdraw from southern
OL,11,FLebanon, in exchange for the
OL,12,Fdisarmament of the Iran-backed
OL,13,FHezbollah militant group.
OL,15,FIt also envisions steps toward an
OL,16,Feventual peace agreement between the
OL,17,Ftwo countries, which technically
OL,18,Fremain in a state of war nearly 80
OL,19,Fyears after Israel's establishment.
OL,26,@pD@MOUpD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,FHezbollah has refused direct talks and
OL,8,Fwasn't party to the deal, which was
OL,9,Fbrokered by the US.
OL,11,FThere have been numerous strikes since
OL,12,Fthe truce went into effect two months
OL,13,Fago, but Saturday's were the deadliest
OL,14,Fso far.
OL,16,FOn June 19, a day before the truce
OL,17,Fwent into effect, Israeli strikes on
OL,18,FLebanon killed 83 and wounded 141,
OL,19,Faccording to the health ministry.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
