FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,FLebanese Prime Minister Nawaf Salam
OL,8,Fcriticised Israel's airstrikes on
OL,9,Fsouthern Lebanon, saying they
OL,10,Fintimidate "residents in their homes"
OL,11,Fand undermine efforts to stabilise the
OL,12,Fsituation in the south.
OL,14,F"Israel must halt this escalation,"
OL,15,FSalam said. He added that the security
OL,16,Fof the Lebanese people and their right
OL,17,Fto life on their land "are not subject
OL,18,Fto negotiation or bargaining."
OL,26,@rD@LOUvD@AOUvD@cO]yD@WOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
