PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,FPresident Joseph Aoun said in comments
OL,8,Freleased by his office that the
OL,9,Fstrikes are "a clear message to the
OL,10,Fnegotiation track and to the American
OL,11,Fefforts aimed at implementing this
OL,12,Fagreement."
OL,14,FThe Israeli military said in a
OL,15,Fstatement that it struck Hezbollah
OL,16,Finfrastructure in the areas of Ali
OL,17,FTaher and Ansar in response to an
OL,18,Faction against Israeli soldiers in the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,26,@qD@MOUtD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
