CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,FThe military added that it will not
OL,8,Fallow Hezbollah to harm Israeli
OL,9,Fcivilians or soldiers "and will
OL,10,Fcontinue to operate to remove threats."
OL,12,FHezbollah called on the Lebanese state
OL,13,Fto find ways to halt "this aggression"
OL,14,Frather than going after US-sponsored
OL,15,Fdirect talks with Israel, as it will
OL,16,Fbe giving "free gifts for the enemy
OL,17,Fdespite the crimes and aggression it
OL,18,Fis carrying out."
OL,26,@qD@WOUrD@gO]uD@VOUuD@fO]xD@KOUzD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
