CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786832292
OL,3,CIsraeli airstrikes on southern Lebanon
OL,4,Ckill 11 people, threatening fragile
OL,5,Ctruce
OL,7,F"The American side is a partner of the
OL,8,FIsraeli enemy in its crimes and
OL,9,Fmassacres," Hezbollah added in the
OL,10,Fstatement.
OL,12,FThe group said that Israel must
OL,13,Fclearly understand that "its acts of
OL,14,Faggression, violations and attempts to
OL,15,Fimpose a fait accompli cannot
OL,16,Fcontinue" and they will be met with an
OL,17,Fappropriate response by Hezbollah.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@KO]uD@YOUxD@IO]
